<title>The Middle Ages — The Pudding</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #1b071a;
    color: #f6eaf4;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
